<h1>Uplifting Sort</h1>
<p>
    Uplifting loops through the array, checking if each element is smaller than the previous.
    If it is not, Uplifting Sort continues to the next element.
    If it is, Uplifting Sort will change the element to be equal to the previous.
    Uplifting Sort only needs to make one pass to "sort" the array.
</p>

